 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 505782,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<span data-math=\"5.08 \\times {10^3} + 6.9 \\times {10^3}\">5.08 \\times {10^3} + 6.9 \\times {10^3}</span>",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Because the powers of 10 match, use the distributive property to factor the power of 10 from the numbers. Then, add the other part of the numbers separately.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"5.08 \\times {10^3} + 6.9 \\times {10^3}\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"\\left( {5.08 + 6.9} \\right) \\times {10^3}\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"11.98 \\times {10^3}\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"1.198 \\times {10^4}\"></span></p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"1.198 \\times {10^4}\">1.198 \\times {10^4}</span>"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 505783,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<span data-math=\"8.968 \\times {10^{ - 38}} - 8.761 \\times {10^{ - 38}}\">8.968 \\times {10^{ - 38}} - 8.761 \\times {10^{ - 38}}</span>",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Because the powers of 10 match, use the distributive property to factor the power of 10 from the numbers. Then, subtract the other part of the numbers separately.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"8.968 \\times {10^{ - 38}} - 8.761 \\times {10^{ - 38}}\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"\\left( {8.968 - 8.761} \\right) \\times {10^{ - 38}}\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"0.207 \\times {10^{ - 38}}\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"2.07 \\times {10^{ - 39}}\"></span></p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"2.07 \\times {10^{ - 39}}\">2.07 \\times {10^{ - 39}}</span>"
